Iron Arm:
doesn't need Enfeeble debuff to cause bleeding when targeting enemies;
removed shock damage boost property;
name changed(again).
---
Bio-lightning:
base damage lowered a bit;
now applies and interacts with vanilla Arc-shock status;
chains to enemies with bleeding/toxin/arc-shock/echopulse;
