---
Synaptic Acceleration:
extra attack doesn't recharge on Metabolic Overcharge selfcast anymore;
changed on-kill ranks formula (20 - INT bonus - PER bonus, min 5) -&gt; (10 - INT bonus / 2 - PER bonus / 2, min 3).
